<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18535" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφρόντ-ιστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thoughtless, heedless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				6.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					10.20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὸ ἀ. ἐπαίρεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					47.11
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>without taking thought, inconsiderately,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					366
				</span></i>
			, Timo <i><span class="en">
				67.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔχειν</span> to be
				<i>heedless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.6.42
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸ μέλλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.79.2
				</span></i>
			; euphem. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφρων εἶναι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				355
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>without causing anxiety,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.30.20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>unthought of, unexpected,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμοὶ δ᾽ ἀγὼν ὅδ᾽ οὐκ ἀ. . . ἦλθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1377
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
